Package: avilistBuilder
Title: Avibase ID Mapping Extractor
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("BirdNET-Pi", "Contributors",
                  email = "contact@birdnetpi.org",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Extracts Avibase ID mappings from the avilistr R package and
    exports to CSV format for use by other BirdNET-Pi extractors. Provides
    the critical link between IOC scientific names and stable Avibase IDs.
